"relationType":"ALTERNATIVE","resolved":false}],"schemaVersion":"1.1.0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":70},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"series":["al-192800"],"seriesIds":[192800],"startDate":{"day":24,"month":6,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":6125,"name":"EMT Squared"},{"animation":false,"id":6998,"name":"TO Books"},{"animation":false,"id":6763,"name":"Yomiuri TV Enterprise"},{"animation":false,"id":6679,"name":"Docomo Anime Store"},{"animation":false,"id":7138,"name":"Bandai Namco Music Live"},{"animation":false,"id":6677,"name":"MAGNET"},{"animation":false,"id":843,"name":"BS Fuji"},{"animation":true,"id":6125,"name":"EMT Squared"},{"animation":false,"id":460,"name":"KLOCKWORX"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"“I will become the world’s most wonderful maid!”\n\nWith her skirt fluttering in black and white, the girl shouted. Her name is Melody. A reincarnated former Japanese girl, she now pursues her dream in her new life, working as an all-purpose maid for a poor count’s family in the kingdom of Théolas. When she makes it, even cheap tea turns into a luxury brew, and a dilapidated mansion is quickly restored to new! Cleaning, serving, hunting, DIY—leave it all to her and her powerful magic. Unbeknownst to Melody, this world is actually an otome game, and she is the most powerful and invincible heroine, the saint! Yet, she remains oblivious to this fact. Romance with handsome men? Attacks by the Demon Lord? Work comes first! A fantasy of misunderstood work that unknowingly shatters destiny!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)\n\nNote: Heroine? Seijo? Iie, All Works Maid desu (Ko)! streamed a week in advance of the TV broadcast on dAnimeStore and ABEMA beginning June 24th, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 1st, 2026."},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":87,"spoiler"